OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for UK's nuclear waste  
OL,4,Adisposal plans?                        
OL,6,FThe government sees nuclear power as   
OL,7,Fkey to its plans to lower bills,       
OL,8,Fimprove energy security and decarbonise
OL,9,Fthe grid. But now safe disposal of the 
OL,10,Findustry's most toxic waste hinges on  
OL,11,Fcommunities in west Cumbria, where some
OL,12,Fare impatient for progress on finding a
OL,13,Fsuitable site.                         
OL,15,FThe government wants to build a        
OL,16,Fgeological disposal facility (GDF), an 
OL,17,Fengineered structure of vaults and     
OL,18,Ftunnels up to 1km (0.6 miles) below    
OL,19,Fground or beneath the seabed.          
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
