OL,3,GNEWSAWhat next for UK's nuclear waste  
OL,4,Adisposal plans?                        
OL,6,FIt would be used to dispose of the UK's
OL,7,Fmost hazardous radioactive waste,      
OL,8,Fincluding spent fuel from nuclear power
OL,9,Fstations.                              
OL,11,FIt could be ready to start receiving   
OL,12,Fwaste in the 2050s and cost between    
OL,13,F#20bn and #53bn in 2017-18 prices,     
OL,14,Faccording to a recent report by MPs.   
